    "answer": {
      "short": "She omitted the diameter. The perimeter is $18\\text{ cm}$ to the nearest whole centimetre.",
      "worked": "Halving the circumference gives only the curved edge. The perimeter also includes the $7\\text{ cm}$ diameter.\n$$\\begin{aligned}P&=\\frac12\\pi d+d\\\\P&=\\frac12\\pi(7)+7\\\\P&=\\frac{7\\pi}{2}+7\\text{ cm}\\\\P&\\approx18\\text{ cm}\\quad\\text{(nearest whole centimetre)}\\end{aligned}$$",
      "solutionDiagrams": []
    },
    "answerSpaceMm": 35
